  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      O <chord name="Bb"/>praise ye the <chord name="Eb"/>Lord! Praise <chord name="Bb/D"/>Him in the <chord name="F"/>height;<br/>
      Re<chord name="Bb/D"/>joice in His <chord name="Gm"/>word, Ye <chord name="C7"/>angels of <chord name="F"/>light;<br/>
      Ye <chord name="Bb"/>heavens, a<chord name="Eb"/>dore Him By <chord name="C7"/>whom ye were <chord name="F"/>made,<br/>
      And <chord name="Gm"/>worship be<chord name="Cm"/>fore Him, In <chord name="Bb/F"/>brightness <chord name="F7"/>ar<chord name="Bb"/>rayed.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      O <chord name="Bb"/>praise ye the <chord name="Eb"/>Lord! Praise <chord name="Bb/D"/>Him upon <chord name="F"/>earth,<br/>
      In <chord name="Bb/D"/>tuneful ac<chord name="Gm"/>cord: Ye <chord name="C7"/>sons of new <chord name="F"/>birth;<br/>
      Praise <chord name="Bb"/>Him who hath <chord name="Eb"/>brought you His <chord name="C7"/>grace from a<chord name="F"/>bove,<br/>
      Praise <chord name="Gm"/>Him who hath <chord name="Cm"/>taught you To <chord name="Bb/F"/>sing of <chord name="F7"/>His <chord name="Bb"/>love.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      O <chord name="Bb"/>praise ye the <chord name="Eb"/>Lord, All <chord name="Bb/D"/>things that give <chord name="F"/>sound;<br/>
      Each <chord name="Bb/D"/>jubilant <chord name="Gm"/>chord, Re<chord name="C7"/>echo a<chord name="F"/>round;<br/>
      Loud <chord name="Bb"/>organs His <chord name="Eb"/>glory Forth <chord name="C7"/>tell in deep <chord name="F"/>tone,<br/>
      And <chord name="Gm"/>sweet harp, the <chord name="Cm"/>story Of <chord name="Bb/F"/>what He <chord name="F7"/>hath <chord name="Bb"/>done.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v4">
      <lines>
      O <chord name="Bb"/>praise ye the <chord name="Eb"/>Lord! Thanks<chord name="Bb/D"/>giving and <chord name="F"/>song<br/>
      To <chord name="Bb/D"/>Him be out<chord name="Gm"/>poured All <chord name="C7"/>ages a<chord name="F"/>long:<br/>
      For <chord name="Bb"/>love in cre<chord name="Eb"/>ation, For <chord name="C7"/>heaven re<chord name="F"/>stored,<br/>
      For <chord name="Gm"/>grace of sal<chord name="Cm"/>vation, O <chord name="Bb/F"/>praise ye <chord name="F7"/>the <chord name="Bb"/>Lord!
      </lines>
    </verse>
